  "At easier levels, move slowly until you learn the movement.": "Pada level yang lebih mudah, gerakkan perlahan hingga Anda mempelajari gerakannya.",
  "At least 120 min of scheduled Zone 2 and about 51 min of hard cardio a week; controlled vigorous blocks on Tuesday, Thursday and Saturday.": "Setidaknya 120 menit dari Zona 2 yang dijadwalkan dan sekitar 51 menit latihan kardio keras dalam seminggu; mengendalikan blok-blok yang kuat pada hari Selasa, Kamis dan Sabtu.",
  "At New to training and Returning, keep the pace brisk and below all-out effort. At Active, work hard. At Well trained, use all-out effort.": "At New to training and Returning, pertahankan kecepatan dan di bawah upaya habis-habisan. At Active, bekerja keras. At Well trained, gunakan upaya sekuat tenaga.",
  "At Returning and above, hold a dumbbell in each hand, or loop a band around your waist with its anchor in front of you. The band should pull you forward, like a sled.": "At Returning and above, pegang dumbel di masing-masing tangan, atau lingkarkan tali di pinggang Anda dengan jangkar di depan Anda. Tali tersebut akan menarik Anda ke depan, seperti kereta luncur.",
  "At Returning, push back up with your hands. At higher levels, pull yourself back with your hamstrings.": "At Returning, dorong kembali dengan tangan Anda. At higher levels, tarik diri Anda ke belakang dengan paha belakang Anda.",
  "At the end of your last interval, note your peak heart rate. Walk gently for 60 seconds and note your heart rate again. Enter the drop (peak minus 60s reading).": "Di akhir interval terakhir Anda, catat detak jantung puncak Anda. Berjalanlah perlahan selama 60 detik dan catat kembali detak jantung Anda. Masukkan drop (puncak minus pembacaan 60an).",
