  "Bryan Johnson's zero-blood, at-home physical testing battery. Track your functional biomarkers against elite 18-year-old and longevity longevity percentiles.": "Baterai pengujian fisik di rumah tanpa darah milik Bryan Johnson. Lacak biomarker fungsional Anda berdasarkan persentil elit umur 18 tahun dan umur panjang.",
  "Bryan measures grip strength as a primary longevity biomarker (scoring ~60 kg, top 5% of all ages). Hanging decompresses the spine and builds forearm grip endurance.": "Bryan mengukur kekuatan cengkeraman sebagai biomarker utama umur panjang (skornya ~60 kg, 5% teratas di semua usia). Menggantung akan mendekompresi tulang belakang dan membangun daya tahan cengkeraman lengan bawah.",
  "Bryan on X: 10 squats every 45 minutes of sitting": "Bryan di X: 10 squat setiap 45 menit duduk",
