  "Strength days take the template’s basics (squat, push-up, row, swing, lunge, presses, step-up, carry, planks) and add his signature Knees-Over-Toes and high-rep posture work.": "Hari-hari kekuatan mengambil dasar-dasar template (jongkok, push-up, mendayung, mengayun, lunge, menekan, melangkah, membawa, papan) dan menambahkan tanda tangan Knees-Over-Toes dan latihan postur repetisi tinggi.",
  "Strength includes lunges, overhead and floor presses, step-ups, swings and carries alongside his signature exercises.": "Kekuatannya mencakup lunge, overhead dan floor press, step-up, swing, dan carry di samping latihan khasnya.",
  "Strength Mon/Wed/Fri with progressive overload, short intervals Tue, Norwegian 4×4 Thu (start with 2–3 rounds, hard but controlled), easy outdoor or social activity Sat, recovery Sun. At least 150 min Zone 2 and 75 min hard cardio, about 10 of them near max.": "Kekuatan Sen/Rabu/Jumat dengan beban berlebih progresif, interval pendek Sel, Norwegia 4×4 Kam (mulai dengan 2–3 putaran, keras namun terkendali), aktivitas luar ruangan atau sosial yang mudah Sabtu, pemulihan Minggu. Setidaknya 150 menit Zona 2 dan 75 menit kardio keras, sekitar 10 menit di antaranya mendekati batas maksimal.",
  "Strength Mon/Wed/Fri, short intervals Tue and Norwegian 4×4 Thu follow Bryan’s template. Saturday adds controlled vigorous work to the indoor Zone 2 session to meet his weekly totals.": "Kekuatan Sen/Rabu/Jumat, interval pendek Sel dan Norwegia 4×4 Kam mengikuti pola Bryan. Sabtu menambahkan kerja keras yang terkontrol ke sesi dalam ruangan Zona 2 untuk memenuhi total mingguannya.",
