  "Ten languages in Settings: English, Romanian, German, Italian, French, Spanish, Simplified Chinese, Hindi, Arabic and Bengali. The interface, exercise names, instructions, plan notes, add-ons and coach audio follow the chosen language.": "Sepuluh bahasa di Pengaturan: Inggris, Rumania, Jerman, Italia, Prancis, Spanyol, Cina Sederhana, Hindi, Arab, dan Bengali. Antarmuka, nama latihan, instruksi, catatan rencana, add-on, dan audio pelatih mengikuti bahasa yang dipilih.",
