  "Turn each add-on on or off, choose how often it repeats (daily or every 2–7 days), and decide whether it appears on Sunday. A repeat counts from the day you set it; Sunday only changes whether the add-on appears that day.": "Aktifkan atau nonaktifkan setiap add-on, pilih seberapa sering add-on tersebut diulang (setiap hari atau setiap 2–7 hari), dan putuskan apakah add-on tersebut muncul pada hari Minggu. Pengulangan dihitung sejak hari Anda menyetelnya; Minggu hanya mengubah apakah add-on muncul pada hari itu.",
  "Turn from your hips and pivot your back foot. Let the turn drive the movement through your arms.": "Berbalik dari pinggul dan putar kaki belakang Anda. Biarkan giliran menggerakkan gerakan melalui lengan Anda.",
  "Turn your chest toward the front knee": "Putar dada Anda ke arah lutut depan",
